{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the art and data book for the rogue-lite equation-like adventure game <i>Cold Bed on Route</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The format is PDF.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 1: Introduction \u2013 A manual-like section similar to the in-game guide: 43 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 2: Illustrations \u2013 Character art and illustrations used both in and out of the game: 42 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 3: Data \u2013 Item lists, location info, and other gameplay data: 105 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 4: Background \u2013 Deeper information about the characters and post-story short fiction: 19 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 5: Closing \u2013 Information about upcoming projects and afterword: 4 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 6: Addendum \u2013 Illustrations and data from the side story <i>Between Dog and Wolf</i>: 41 pages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Excluding the cover, table of contents, and colophon, the total comes to 254 pages.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771910?t=1749476374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771910/4aed001a9f3100f2ded54a28c9e179944d13493b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749476374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771910/d27f8b9da52b16a1f5205fc8390b002f81f10430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749476374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771910/d27f8b9da52b16a1f5205fc8390b002f81f10430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749476374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descript